{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/27/7999710/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京女子流さん！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の大好きな\n女子流さん！！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にお会いしたのですが\nやっぱり可愛かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/27/7999710/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子流さんの楽曲と歌とダンスが好きだから\nまたライブ観に行かなきゃ！って思いました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮前だからか\n観覧すごく多かったですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/27/7999710/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nなんか頭が全然回ってなかったですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後に\n放送を聴いて気づくパターンじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送中、既に\nどうしよう言葉がでてこないー\nってなってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調を仕事に影響させちゃうの\n本当によくない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/27/7999710/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週も聴いてほしいです\nお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部＃26』\n配信されました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/186937/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、観てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/27/7999710/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は神宮だーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}